# DPCP — Build methodology (all projects)

On **every** task in this monorepo, follow **[docs/DPCS_BUILD_METHODOLOGY.md](docs/DPCS_BUILD_METHODOLOGY.md)** (Autonomous Builder / PLUGIN FACTORY OS).

**DPCP = DPCS:** Discover → Plan (Specify) → Code (vertical slices) → Ship/Prove (evidence + draft PR).

1. **Discover** — Read `/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, relevant product `ARCHITECTURE.md`, and task-specific prompts. Search for reuse. Docs-only first commit when greenfield.
2. **Plan** — Specs and architecture in git before bulk implementation (`PRODUCT_SPEC`, APIs, manifests, success criteria).
3. **Code** — One vertical slice at a time; green build/test per slice; stay inside the named product folder.
4. **Prove** — Run stack-appropriate validation from `AGENTS.md`; walkthrough artifacts for UI; never claim CI/pluginval passed without running it.

**Hard stops:** mega-diffs; secrets in repo; skipping Plan; merge/deploy without explicit user ask.

**Plugins:** Detail slices in [PLUGIN_FACTORY_OS_PROMPT.md](docs/PLUGIN_FACTORY_OS_PROMPT.md) §0 — same DPCP loop.

**DiskLordz ROM/content only (optional extra):** [DisklordzSynth/Docs/CONTENT_PLATFORM_ROADMAP.md](DisklordzSynth/Docs/CONTENT_PLATFORM_ROADMAP.md) — still one DPCP slice at a time.
